11:55Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Multiple I think", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-29T04:15:00Z", "username": "Abhishek S", "text": "I did a complete reading of the first two books, with voices and all, and in Hindi, to my sister to get her into it when we were young. I had to cause I used her vouchers from Teksons Bookshop that she won in HT Pace quiz to buy the series. This was when the fourth book had come out.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-29T04:17:06Z", "username": "Shvetal", "text": "I’ve read all the HP books out loud to my older daughter, but I’ve also read a lot of other books out loud to her, including a lot of classics. With the younger one she’s just had to read things on her own!", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-29T04:18:15Z", "username": "Shvetal", "text": "I am hoping to get back to reading to her too.", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2025-09-29T04:20:36Z", "username": "Akshay", "text": "I was mistaken btw. 2024* was pv sindhu ‎<This message was edited>", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]